Target yaw is positive RIGHT: fix the comments and doc that say left, and label the dashboard columns.
PhotonVision computes yaw = atan((u - cx) / fx) (TargetCalculations.calculateYawPitch) and
TargetCalculationsTest asserts it's positive for a target right of centre; PhotonUtils and
PhotonCameraSim agree. The PhotonTrackedTarget comments (Java, C++) and getting-target-data.md
said positive left. Comments and docs only: no behaviour changes.

--- a/photon-targeting/src/main/java/org/photonvision/targeting/PhotonTrackedTarget.java
