+    /**
+     * The yaw of the target in degrees, with RIGHT being the positive direction (clockwise, the
+     * opposite of WPILib's counter-clockwise angles). PhotonVision computes it as atan((u - cx) /
+     * fx) in TargetCalculations.calculateYawPitch, and TargetCalculationsTest asserts it's positive
+     * for a target right of centre.
+     */
     public double yaw;
 
     /** The pitch of the target in degrees, with up being the positive direction. */
